$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Phthaloylation Powdered phtalic anhydride (0.14 g, 1 mmol) was added to a
stirred solution of 2-methylbut-3-yn-2-amine (0.09 g, 1.0 mmol) in ethyl
acetate (2 ml) at room temperature. The progress of the reaction was
monitored by TLC. The reaction was complete within 16 h. The reaction was
concentrated under reduced pressure (method A) and then dried under
vacuum with a potassium hydroxide trap.
2-{[(1,1-Dimethylprop-2-yn-1-yl)amino]carbonyl}benzoic acid (Table 2,
entry 13) was obtained as a white solid in 97% yield.
2-{[(1,1-Dimethylprop-2-yn-1-yl)amino]carbonyl}benzoic acid, yield 97%.
Mp 135-138°C; FT-IR (KBr): 2984, 2840, 2105, 1699, 1666, 1645, 1541,
1300, 923 cm-1. 1H NMR (200 MHz, DMSO-d6): δ = 11.78 (br s, 1H), 8.39 (s,
1H), 7.86-7.63 (m, 1H), 7.60-7.25 (m, 3H), 3.08 (s, 1H), 1.58 (s, 6H).
13C NMR (50 MHz, DMSO-d6): δ = 168.0, 167.7, 138.7, 131.0, 130.7, 129.1,
128.8, 127.8, 88.2, 70.6, 46.5, 28.7(2C). GC-MS (EI): m/z 231 (M+, 7%),
216 (10), 203 (77), 188 (34), 146 (56), 130 (100), 104 (52), 76 (45), 56
(27). Anal. calcd. for C13H13NO3: C, 67.52; H, 5.67; N, 6.96. Found: C,
67.78; H, 5.89; N, 6.73.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Additive-free chemoselective acylation of amines
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Temperini, Andrea; Terlizzi, Raffaella; Testaferri, Lorenzo; Tiecco,
Marcello
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Synthetic Communications (2010), 40(2), 295-302

